  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC. The charged-particle pseudorapidity density in Xe--Xe collisions at $\\sqrt{s_{_{\\mathrm{NN}}}} = 5.44\\,\\mathrm{TeV}$ in centrality classes measured by ALICE.  The measurement covers a wide pseudorapidity range from $-3.5$ to $5$. The distributions of $\\mathrm{d}N_\\mathrm{ch}/\\mathrm{d}\\eta$, the densities of the distributions at mid-rapidity and $N^\\mathrm{tot}_\\mathrm{ch}$ are presented. \n",
